{"table":"documents","conflict":["public_id"],"refs":{"author_id":{"table":"members","public_id":"00000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000008"}},"row":{"body":"Any player can call a pause. The pause is not discussed as part of the fiction. Play resumes when the caller says so.","category":"table","deleted_by":null,"kind":"rule","public_id":"00000002-0000-4000-8000-00000000006c","published_at":"2026-09-14T18:00:00Z","published_by":null,"slug":"safety-pause","status":"published","title":"Safety Pause","version":0,"visibility":"public"}}
{"table":"documents","conflict":["public_id"],"refs":{"author_id":{"table":"members","public_id":"00000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000003"}},"row":{"body":"The party redrew Osric's chalk line and lost a wheel anyway. They paid the compact in nails and a true story about the Red Mile.","category":"session","deleted_by":null,"kind":"summary","public_id":"00000002-0000-4000-8000-00000000006d","published_at":"2026-09-14T18:00:00Z","published_by":null,"slug":"session-at-the-ford","status":"published","title":"Session at the Ford","version":0,"visibility":"public"}}
{"table":"documents","conflict":["public_id"],"refs":{"author_id":{"table":"members","public_id":"00000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000004"}},"row":{"body":"Sable sold a margin that named a boat the salt ledger does not have. The tower has not been told. The choir has.","category":"session","deleted_by":null,"kind":"summary","public_id":"00000002-0000-4000-8000-00000000006e","published_at":"2026-09-14T18:00:00Z","published_by":null,"slug":"session-in-the-loft","status":"published","title":"Session in the Loft","version":0,"visibility":"public"}}
{"table":"documents","conflict":["public_id"],"refs":{"author_id":{"table":"members","public_id":"00000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000005"}},"row":{"body":"The middle landing was flooded. Nim charged fish, not coin. Ysolde refunded a passage and kept the story of who slipped.","category":"session","deleted_by":null,"kind":"summary","public_id":"00000002-0000-4000-8000-00000000006f","published_at":"2026-09-14T18:00:00Z","published_by":null,"slug":"session-on-the-stair","status":"published","title":"Session on the Stair","version":0,"visibility":"public"}}
{"table":"documents","conflict":["public_id"],"refs":{"author_id":{"table":"members","public_id":"00000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000006"}},"row":{"body":"The slate went up. Two boats waited. One did not. The patrol's note is in the counting house and the compact's note disagrees.","category":"session","deleted_by":null,"kind":"summary","public_id":"00000002-0000-4000-8000-000000000070","published_at":"2026-09-14T18:00:00Z","published_by":null,"slug":"session-after-dark-night","status":"published","title":"Session after Dark Night","version":0,"visibility":"public"}}
{"table":"documents","conflict":["public_id"],"refs":{"author_id":{"table":"members","public_id":"00000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000007"}},"row":{"body":"They camped on the last mapped rise. Something walked the unmapped side and did not cross. Est added a line to a list nobody posted.","category":"session","deleted_by":null,"kind":"summary","public_id":"00000002-0000-4000-8000-000000000071","published_at":"2026-09-14T18:00:00Z","published_by":null,"slug":"session-in-grey-lip","status":"published","title":"Session in Grey Lip","version":0,"visibility":"public"}}
{"table":"documents","conflict":["public_id"],"refs":{"author_id":{"table":"members","public_id":"00000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000008"}},"row":{"body":"A fare sheet arrived with both seals. Both offices tore it. The party still has a third copy, and has not decided who to anger.","category":"session","deleted_by":null,"kind":"summary","public_id":"00000002-0000-4000-8000-000000000072","published_at":"2026-09-14T18:00:00Z","published_by":null,"slug":"session-of-the-two-seals","status":"published","title":"Session of the Two Seals","version":0,"visibility":"dm_only"}}
{"table":"documents","conflict":["public_id"],"refs":{"author_id":{"table":"members","public_id":"00000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000002"}},"row":{"body":"Brune runs the coast road on Thursdays. Recap at the start. Five seats. One is open after Ember.","category":"notice","deleted_by":null,"kind":"community","public_id":"00000002-0000-4000-8000-000000000073","published_at":"2026-09-14T18:00:00Z","published_by":null,"slug":"thursday-coast-table","status":"published","title":"Thursday Coast Table","version":0,"visibility":"public"}}
{"table":"documents","conflict":["public_id"],"refs":{"author_id":{"table":"members","public_id":"00000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000003"}},"row":{"body":"Pell's archon table reads bargains aloud. Bring the writing. Spoken deals are treated as drafts.","category":"notice","deleted_by":null,"kind":"community","public_id":"00000002-0000-4000-8000-000000000074","published_at":"2026-09-14T18:00:00Z","published_by":null,"slug":"charter-review-night","status":"published","title":"Charter Review Night","version":0,"visibility":"public"}}
